abstract: "A comprehensive, multi-task industrial AI platform incorporating supervised regression (16 models), operational risk classification (14 models), unsupervised health monitoring (5 anomaly detectors), sequential observation forecasting, SHAP interpretability, and interactive decision support for gas turbine emission and energy yield optimization."

